epositRequesters!\");\n        console.log(\"  user Result: 1000 claimable tokens now INVISIBLEusern\");\n        \n        // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n        // STEP 4: Fulfill and Claim Cancellation (Clear the counter)\n        // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n        \n        console.log(\"STEP 4: Clear Cancellation Counter\");\n        \n        vm.prank(investmentManager);\n        mainVault.fulfillCancelDepositRequest(user);\n        \n        vm.prank(user);\n        mainVault.claimCancelDepositRequest(0, user, user);\n        \n        console.log(\"  user Cancellation claimed\");\n        console.log(\"  user totalCancelDepositAssets = 0 nowusern\");\n        \n        // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n        // STEP 5: Simulate Investment (Drain Vault Balance)\n        // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n        \n        console.log(\"STEP 5: Simulate External Investment\");\n        \n        uint256 vaultBalance = asset.balanceOf(address(mainVault));\n        vm.prank(address(mainVault));\n        asset.transfer(investmentManager, vaultBalance);\n        \n        uint256 finalBalance = asset.balanceOf(address(mainVault));\n        console.log(\"  user Vault balance:\", finalBalance);\n        console.log(\"  user All assets invested externallyusern\");\n        \n        // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n        // STEP 6: Verify The Invisible Liability\n        // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n        \n        console.log(\"STEP 6: Verify The Invisible Liability\");\n\n                    // Check Alice's ACTUAL claimable balance (still exists!)\n        uint256 userClaimableBeforeUnreg = mainVault.claimableDepositRequest(0, user);\n        console.log(\"  user claimableDepositAssets[alice]:\", userClaimableBeforeUnreg / 1e18, \"tokens\");\n        console.log(\"    user has NOT called deposit() yet - funds waiting \");\n\n        (bool success, bytes memory data) = address(mainVault).call(\n            abi.encodeWithSignature(\"getVaultMetrics()\")\n        );\n        assertTrue(success);\n        \n        console.log(\"  Vault Metrics:\");\n        console.log(\"  user totalPendingDepositAssets: 0 user\");\n        console.log(\"  user totalCancelDepositAssets: 0 user\");\n        console.log(\"  user activeDepositRequestersCount: 0 user (WRONG!)\");\n        console.log(\"  user vault balance: 0 user\");\n        console.log(\"  user user's 1000 claimable: INVISIBLE!usern\");\n        \n        // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n        // STEP 7: Unregister Vault (PROTOCOL INVARIANT VIOLATED!)\n        // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n        \n        console.log(\"STEP 7: Unregister Vault (While Alice Has Unclaimed Funds!)\");\n        \n        console.log(\"   CRITICAL STATE BEFORE UNREGISTRATION:\");\n        console.log(\"   claimableDepositAssets[user]:\", userClaimableBeforeUnreg / 1e18, \"tokens\");\n        console.log(\"   Alice has NOT called deposit() to claim yet\");\n        console.log(\"   But activeDepositRequestersCount = 0 (false!)\");\n        console.log(\"   Unregistration check will INCORRECTLY pass\\n\");\n        \n        //Vault is set to Inactive before unregister\n        mainVault.setVaultActive(false);\n        \n        // This SHOULD FAIL but will SUCCEED due to bug\n        mainShareToken.unregisterVault(address(asset));\n        \n        address registeredVault = mainShareToken.vault(address(asset));\n        assertEq(registeredVault, address(0), \"Vault should be unregistered\");\n        \n        console.log(\"  CRITICAL: Vault unregistered successfully!\");\n        console.log(\"   All safety checks passed (incorrectly)\");\n        console.log(\"   Protocol invariant VIOLATED\\n\");\n        \n        // Verify Alice STILL has claimable balance after unregistration\n        uint256 userClaimableAfterUnreg = mainVault.claimableDepositRequest(0, user);\n        console.log(\"  AFTER UNREGISTRATION:\");\n        console.log(\"   Vault status: UNREGISTERED \");\n        console.log(\"  !!!BUG CONFIRMED!!! claimableDepositAssets[user]:\", userClaimableAfterUnreg / 1e18, \"tokens\"); //Bug confirmed\n        console.log(\"   1000 tokens orphaned in unregistered vault!\");\n        \n        // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n        // STEP 8: Verify user CAN Still Claim (But Shouldn't Be Possible)\n        // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n        \n        console.log(\"STEP 8: user Attempts to Claim\");\n        \n        uint256 aliceBalanceBefore = mainShareToken.balanceOf(user);\n        \n        vm.prank(user);\n        mainVault.deposit(firstDeposit, user, user);\n        \n        uint256 aliceBalanceAfter = mainShareToken.balanceOf(user);\n        \n        console.log(\"  user user balance before:\", aliceBalanceBefore / 1e18);\n        console.log(\"  user user balance after:\", aliceBalanceAfter / 1e18);\n        console.log(\"  user user Claim succeeded (deposit() still works)\");\n        console.log(\"  user BUT vault should NOT have been unregistered!usern\");\n    }\n```",
